## 4. Amount Unit Pitfall

**All amounts must be in the smallest currency unit.**

```kotlin
// ✅ Correct for $12.34 USD
val amount = AmountInfo(
    orderAmount = BigDecimal("1234"),  // 1234 cents = $12.34
    pricingCurrency = "USD"
)

// ❌ Wrong — SDK treats 12.34 as 12.34 cents = $0.1234
val wrong = AmountInfo(
    orderAmount = BigDecimal("12.34"),
    pricingCurrency = "USD"
)
```

**Conversion helper:**
```kotlin
fun dollarsToSmallestUnit(dollars: Double): BigDecimal =
    BigDecimal(dollars).multiply(BigDecimal("100")).setScale(0, RoundingMode.HALF_UP)
```

