## 5. INIT Session Concept

> The SDK runs an **INIT handshake** with Tapro on the **first payment operation** after connecting — not inside `onConnected`.

**Implications:**
- The first transaction after connecting may take slightly longer (INIT overhead)
- If the transport **disconnects and reconnects**, INIT state is **cleared** — the next transaction re-runs INIT
- Do **not** cache or assume INIT remains valid after a disconnect/reconnect cycle

```kotlin
// onConnected fires when transport is ready — INIT happens on first client.sale()/etc.
override fun onConnected(deviceId: String, taproVersion: String) {
    // Safe to show "Connected" UI
    // INIT will run automatically on the next transaction call
}
```

---

## 6. Timeout Recovery (Error 306)

Error `306` = response timeout. The transaction **may have been processed**. Always query first.

```kotlin
// Store the ID before sending
val txnRequestId = "TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}"
currentTxnRequestId = txnRequestId

val request = SaleRequest.builder()
    .setTransactionRequestId(txnRequestId)
    // ...
    .build()

client.sale(request, object : PaymentCallback {
    override fun onFailure(error: PaymentError) {
        if (error.code == "306") {
            // MUST check status before creating new transaction
            queryWithPolling(txnRequestId)
        }
    }
})
```

---

## 7. PaymentResult Status vs Response Code

`PaymentResult` has two separate indicators:

| Field | Values | Meaning |
|-------|--------|---------|
| `code` | `"0"` or other | SDK/gateway communication result |
| `transactionStatus` | `"SUCCESS"` / `"PROCESSING"` / `"FAILED"` | Actual payment outcome |

**Always check both:**
```kotlin
override fun onSuccess(result: PaymentResult) {
    // onSuccess is called even when transactionStatus is "FAILED"
    when {
        result.isSuccess()    -> confirmPayment(result)
        result.isProcessing() -> queryWithPolling(result.transactionRequestId!!)
        result.isFailed()     -> showError(result.message ?: "Transaction failed")
    }
}
```

