## 8. Card Network Routing

```kotlin
// Explicitly route to credit or debit
SaleRequest.builder()
    .setCardNetworkType(CardNetworkType.CREDIT)   // Force credit network
    // or
    .setCardNetworkType(CardNetworkType.DEBIT)    // Force debit network
    // Omit for auto-detection (terminal decides)
```

---

## 9. Receipt Control

```kotlin
// Control whether Tapro app prints receipts
SaleRequest.builder()
    .setPrintReceipt(PrintReceipt.AUTO)      // Default: terminal decides
    .setPrintReceipt(PrintReceipt.NONE)      // No printing
    .setPrintReceipt(PrintReceipt.MERCHANT)  // Merchant copy only
    .setPrintReceipt(PrintReceipt.CUSTOMER)  // Customer copy only
    .setPrintReceipt(PrintReceipt.BOTH)      // Both copies
```

